{{also|Market|märket|Märket}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{dercat|en|ett}}
From {{inh|en|enm|market}}, from late {{inh|en|ang|market||market}} and {{der|en|xno|markiet}} ({{der|en|fro|marchié}}); both ultimately from {{der|en|la|mercātus||trade, market}}, from {{m|la|mercor||I trade, deal in, buy}}, itself derived from {{m|la|merx||wares, merchandise}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|merk}}, {{cog|nl|markt}}, {{cog|goh|Markt}}.

